  "summary": "The E-Link gateway reads the YR OptiView microboard over YorkTalk 3 and serves BACnet, N2, LON and Modbus objects. This entry merges the standard-starter and solid-state-starter tabs: remote setpoint, current limit and start/stop, water temperatures and pressures, motor current, starter values and status codes.",
